# Production (packaged .exe / Tauri) build settings.
#
# Disable NPL India time sync: a desktop build has no Vite dev proxy or nginx,
# so the relative "/npl-time" route can't resolve and every sync would fail.
# The app already falls back to the local machine clock, so disabling it just
# removes the failing fetch. Override here if you expose a CORS-enabled NTP URL.
VITE_NPL_TIME_URL=disabled
